  "keyFeatures": [
    "Zero-install ROS 2 bridge — single static binary, no rclcpp or colcon required",
    "Automatic topic discovery on both DDS and Zenoh transports simultaneously",
    "Real-time streaming to the bundled Rewire Viewer (custom Rerun build with ROS 2 panels)",
    "74 built-in ROS 2 message type mappings to Rerun archetypes",
    "Custom JSON5 message mappings for any ROS 2 type — no code required",
    "URDF and TF tree visualization with automatic mesh resolution",
    "MCAP bag playback and conversion to RRD files",
    "Per-topic diagnostics: Hz, bandwidth, drop count, and latency",
    "WebSocket API to stream live ROS 2 data to any client",
    "Headless relay (rewire serve) for multi-bridge and multi-viewer fleet topologies",
    "Runtime recording control via loopback gRPC — start new recordings without restarting"
  ],
